flowchart TD
  A[Raw reports buffered\nper nodeId] --> B{Fusion window\n(1s) elapsed?}
  B -- no --> A
  B -- yes --> C[Build undirected constraints\nrange + AoA]
  C --> D[Seed/ensure pose graph]
  D --> E{Any real anchors\n(report x/y)?}
  E -- yes --> F[Pin anchors in graph]
  E -- no --> G[Virtual anchor: pin seed node\n(to fix translation)]
  F --> H[Optimize warmup iterations]
  G --> H
  H --> I{robustFusion?}
  I -- no --> J[Optimize final iterations]
  I -- yes --> K[Compute residuals\n(dist + angle)]
  K --> L[Huber weights per edge]
  L --> J
  J --> M[Emit fused records\nfrom graph node poses]
  M --> N[Clear buffer]
